## Mode 3: Health Report

### Step 1: Fetch all open issues

```
gh issue list --state open --limit 100 --json number,title,labels,author,createdAt,updatedAt
```

### Step 2: Generate report

```
=== Stigmer GitHub Issue Health Report ===
Date: {current date}
Repo: stigmer/stigmer

--- Summary ---
Open issues: {count}
Average age: {days}
Oldest issue: #{number} ({title}) — {age} days

--- By Priority ---
High: {count} issues
Medium: {count} issues
Low: {count} issues
Unlabeled priority: {count} issues

--- By Component ---
{component}: {count} issues
...

--- Needs Attention ---
[STALE] #{number} {title} — no activity for {days} days
[NO LABELS] #{number} {title} — needs triage
[NO PRIORITY] #{number} {title} — has type/component but missing priority
[IN PROGRESS > 7d] #{number} {title} — marked in-progress but no update in {days} days

--- Closed This Week ---
#{number} {title} — closed {relative_time}
```

